														<p class="brfprofile">Dr. Yamini Pandey is currently working as Professor of OB and HR. She has around 15 Years of experience in Academics. Her research interest ranges from job satisfaction, organization culture, organizational effectiveness Emotional intelligence and Entrepreneurial intentions. She earned her doctorate degree from Faculty of Management - Pacific University, Udaipur. She has published research papers and articles in national and international journals of good repute. She was associated with Private universities for more than seven years. Five Ph.D.’s and one M.Phil. have been awarded under her supervision. She has been associated with few UGC care and Scopus journals as Reviewer. Dr. Pandey has one copyright and two patents to her credit. She has also authored one text book and two edited books.</p>

